# Live files

App root: `Order Packing List Generator/`.

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `packing_list_app.py` / pipeline scripts | Live packing pipeline |
| `Data/Workbook.xlsx` | Process sheets live; **CL Database sheet archive-only** (lookup retired) |
| `../Custom Label Database/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | Step 2 enrich source of truth |
| `Data/New SKU Database.csv` | DTF Des Item-SKU remap only |
| `Input/` | ShipStation CSV exports |
| `Output/` | Process CSVs, PDFs, Picking / Orders Details / DTF Des |
| `../Shared Inbox/DTF Des/{date}/{shift}/` | Dual-write of DTF Des (handoff) |
| `preflight_issues_app.py`, `missing_run_app.py` | Helper tools |

SKU match: `shared/cl_sku_match.py` (whole → after-first-dash → till-last-dash) on Custom Label.
Column maps in `enrich_cl_lookup.py` (e.g. Position ← Print Positions, Picture Name ← Apparel Image, Prime ← Amazon Prime). Logo/Design Image left blank from CL.
